 r←Test_CreateButtonForm_012(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "Dialog.Create": height test; the "size" parameter defines the height.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.question←'Are you really really sure about this?'
 parms.buttons←'Yes' 'No'
 parms.size←450 ⍬
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateButtonForm myGuiParms parms
 ⎕DL 0.2
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.AdjustSize n
 →(0≡T.PassesIf n.∆Form.Size[0]∊445+⍳10)/∆TidyUp

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm

 r←T._OK
